{"sha": "51719af8f25fffd4f6cbbe54126f493516b37f136f79e3383877904a1de1ecb4", "body": ["{\\small 三种占据律关于 $(\\epsilon -", "\\mu)/k_{\\text{B}}T$ 的图像：费米子每个态至多占据一个（", "在 $\\epsilon = \\mu$ 处为平滑阶跃），玻色子无限堆积，", "当 $\\epsilon \\to \\mu$ 时，二者在右侧都汇入稀薄的玻尔兹曼尾部——", "经典区域正是一个态很少被占据的地方，", "几乎从不被占据。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{吸附：租用的位点}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[朗缪尔等温线]\\label{prop:b3:grand-canonical:langmuir}", "\\index{朗缪尔等温线}\\index{吸附}", "表面提供相互独立的位点，每个位点或空着，或吸附一个气体", "分子，其结合能为 $-\\epsilon_0$；上方的气体", "压强为 $P$，是能量库。每个位点是一个两态巨正则", "体系，其占据数为", "\\[", "\\theta = \\frac{1}{\\eu^{\\beta(-\\epsilon_0 - \\mu)} + 1}", " = \\frac{P}{P + P_0(T)} , \\qquad", "P_0(T) = \\frac{k_{\\text{B}}T}{\\lambda_T^3}\\,", "\\eu^{-\\epsilon_0/k_{\\text{B}}T} ,", "\\]", "使用理想气体的 $\\mu$。低压下覆盖度线性增长，", "并在单分子层处饱和——即\\emph{朗缪尔等温线}，", "它是催化转化器、活性炭、防毒面具以及血液携氧", "过程所遵循的工作曲线", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:grand-canonical:6}）。过渡压强 $P_0$", "随结合能\\emph{指数式}下降，并", "随温度急剧上升：加热表面会把其上的“住客”赶走——", "这正是真空烘烤玻璃器皿能真正清洁它的原因。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "位点的占据数为", "\\cref{thm:b3:grand-canonical:occupation}（费米子形式：每个位点", "至多容纳一个粒子），取 $\\epsilon = -\\epsilon_0$；代入", "$\\eu^{\\beta\\mu} = n\\lambda_T^3 = P\\lambda_T^3/k_{\\text{B}}T$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=10.8cm, height=5.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=5, ymin=0, ymax=1.12,", "    xlabel={低温时的 $P/P_0$}, ylabel={覆盖度 $\\theta$},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={1,2,3,4}, ytick={0.5,1}, clip=false,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.97,0.42)}, anchor=north east,", "      draw=none, fill=none}]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0:5, samples=120] {x/(x+1)};", "    \\addlegendentry{低温表面}", "    \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=0:5, samples=120] {x/(x+6)};", "    \\addlegendentry{高温表面（$P_0$ 更大）}", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (axis cs:0,1) -- (axis cs:5,1);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south east, gray] at (axis cs:4.9,1.0)", "      {单分子层};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 朗缪尔等温线：覆盖度随压强变化，", "在单分子层处饱和。加热表面后，要达到相同的覆盖度", "需要高得多的压强——吸附是一场 $\\mu$ 的协商，而高温表面", "总是输掉这场协商。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{电离平衡：萨哈方程}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[萨哈方程]\\label{prop:b3:grand-canonical:saha}", "\\index{萨哈方程}", "在热气体中，反应 $\\text{H} \\rightleftharpoons \\text{p} +", "\\text{e}$ 达到平衡的条件为 $\\mu_{\\text{H}} = \\mu_{\\text{p}} +", "\\mu_{\\text{e}}$。用理想气体形式写出每个 $\\mu$（", "原子计入其结合能 $-E_{\\text{I}}$），得到", "\\[", "\\frac{n_{\\text{e}}\\,n_{\\text{p}}}{n_{\\text{H}}}", " = \\frac{1}{\\lambda_{T,\\text{e}}^3}\\,", "\\eu^{-E_{\\text{I}}/k_{\\text{B}}T}", "\\qquad\\Big(\\lambda_{T,\\text{e}} =", "h/\\sqrt{2\\pi m_{\\text{e}}k_{\\text{B}}T}\\Big)", "\\]", "（至多相差数量级为一的自旋简并因子）。这里又有两种相互竞争的“货币”：", "玻尔兹曼因子对电离征收", "$E_{\\text{I}} = \\qty{13.6}{eV}$ 的“税”，而前因子——", "\\emph{被释放电子的熵}，连同其 $\\lambda_T^{-3}$", "所对应的可及态数——则给予电离“补贴”。这笔补贴", "在恒星密度下大得足以使氢", "在 \\qty{10000}{K} 附近就已显著电离，此时 $k_{\\text{B}}T$ 仅为", "\\qty{0.9}{eV}：平衡之争在于自由能，而非能量——", "而恒星的光谱正是这本账本", "（见\\cref{pb:b3:grand-canonical:1}）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "令 $\\mu_{\\text{H}} = \\mu_{\\text{p}} + \\mu_{\\text{e}}$，其中 $\\mu_i", "= k_{\\text{B}}T\\ln(n_i\\lambda_{T,i}^3) + \\varepsilon_i$", "（$\\varepsilon_{\\text{H}} = -E_{\\text{I}}$，其余为零）；", "两边取指数。质子与原子的热波长近似相消", "（质量相等）；简并因子在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=10.8cm, height=5.4cm, xmin=3000, xmax=25000, ymin=0, ymax=1.1,", "    xlabel={$T$ (K)}, ylabel={氢的电离比例},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={5000,10000,15000,20000}, ytick={0.5,1}, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=3000:25000, samples=300]", "      {1/(1+exp(-(x-9600)/1100))};", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (axis cs:9600,0) -- (axis cs:9600,0.5);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:10000,0.28)", "      {\\qty{10000}{K} 附近半电离};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}